+# US-01.5 – Canton for the pension fund for every employee
+
+Part of [Employee onboarding questionnaire](../feature.md), section [1. Personal details and home address](../feature.md#SEC-01-identity-and-address).
+
+**As** pension fund, **I want** Lonio to record a canton for every new employee: the canton of residence the employee gave if they live in Switzerland, and Zurich (Muster AG's place of work) if they live abroad, **so that** the required 'Canton' field of the registration is never empty, without asking employees abroad anything
+
+Priority **P1** – 'Canton' is a required field. Pensionskasse Muster rejects a registration without it, and employees living abroad give no canton in the questionnaire. · Sources: F-fund_email-90df7e, F-fund_email-cb5bde, F-fund_email-a03d8c, F-fund_email-be1403, F-pension_portal-587d3f, F-pension_portal-44a27b, D-002, D-037
+
+> ⚠ Open questions affecting this section: [OQ-canton-abroad](../open-questions.md#oq-canton-abroad), [OQ-canton-derivation](../open-questions.md#oq-canton-derivation)
+Covers (details in [the section](../feature.md#SEC-01-identity-and-address) and [information.md](../information.md)): Canton, Country (home address), Canton for the pension fund
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+- **AC-01.5.1 Residents of Switzerland: the canton they chose**
+  - **Given** the employee's home address country is Switzerland and they chose their canton of residence in the questionnaire
+  - **When** the canton for the pension fund is determined
+  - **Then** the canton recorded for the pension fund registration is the canton the employee chose.
+  - _Sources: F-fund_email-90df7e, F-pension_portal-587d3f, D-002_
+
+  | Example | Country (home address) | Canton | → | Canton for the pension fund | Checked |
+  |---|---|---|---|---|---|
+  | Employee living in Switzerland who chose Bern (illustrative) | Switzerland | Bern | → | Bern | ✅ |
+  | Employee living in Switzerland who chose Zurich (illustrative) | Switzerland | Zurich | → | Zurich | ✅ |
+
+- **AC-01.5.2 Employees living abroad: Zurich, the canton of the place of work**
+  - **Given** the employee's home address country is not Switzerland
+  - **When** the canton for the pension fund is determined
+  - **Then** the canton recorded for the pension fund registration is Zurich, the canton of Muster AG's place of work. The employee is not asked anything for it.
+  - _Sources: F-fund_email-cb5bde, F-fund_email-a03d8c, F-fund_email-be1403_
+
+  | Example | Country (home address) | → | Canton for the pension fund | Canton | Checked |
+  |---|---|---|---|---|---|
+  | Employee living in Germany (e.g. Konstanz) (illustrative) | Germany | → | Zurich | not asked | ✅ |
+  | Employee living in Liechtenstein (illustrative) | Liechtenstein | → | Zurich | not asked | ✅ |
+  | Employee living in another country (illustrative) | France | → | Zurich | not asked | ✅ |
+
+- **AC-01.5.3 The fund's canton follows the latest answers**
+  - **Given** the home address country or the canton of residence has changed
+  - **When** the canton for the pension fund is determined
+  - **Then** it is derived again from the latest home address country and canton of residence, never from an earlier value.
+  - _Sources: D-037, F-fund_email-90df7e, F-fund_email-cb5bde_
+
